  "prefLabel": "En 1502.01 Abutter",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1502.01 \"Abutter\" means a person who is the owner of land encumbered by any crossing of public waters, or the border of which adjoins any crossing of public waters.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
